              },
              "lightning:margin" : "{!$brand.spacing.none}",
              "lightning:padding" : "{!$brand.spacing.none}",
              "lightning:typography" : "{!$brand.typography.paragraph.paragraph1}",
              "text" : "At Zeta, love is the foundation of an extraordinary education. For eight years, our top-performing, tuition-free public charter schools have served New York City families through rigorous academics and meaningful opportunities that nurture the whole child.<br /><br />As the founder, my vision for Zeta grew out of the kind of school my husband and I wanted for our three sons: a school where students receive an excellent education, develop a lifelong love of learning, and grow in confidence, curiosity, and character. My nine-year-old son attends Zeta, so I experience our schools every day as both a Zeta leader and a proud Zeta parent.<br />"
