            "lightning:padding" : "{!$brand.spacing.xSmall}",
            "lightning:verticalAlignment" : "top"
          },
          "definition" : "lightning/column",
          "id" : "71e9f34c-2c74-4326-b350-b6fd2d6483cd",
          "type" : "block",
          "children" : [ {
            "attributes" : {
              "align" : "start",
              "lightning:borderRadius" : "{!$brand.borderRadius.square}",
              "lightning:borderWidth" : "{!$brand.borderWeight.none}",
              "lightning:colorGroup" : {
                "backgroundColor" : "{!$brand.colorScheme.root}",
                "borderColor" : "{!$brand.colorScheme.neutral}",
                "linkColor" : "{!$brand.colorScheme.primaryAccent}",
                "textColor" : "{!$brand.colorScheme.contrast}"
              },
              "lightning:margin" : "{!$brand.spacing.none}",
              "lightning:padding" : "{!$brand.spacing.none}",
              "lightning:typography" : "{!$brand.typography.paragraph.paragraph1}",
              "text" : "Our commitment is to provide your student with a world-class educational experience grounded in love, from kindergarten through twelfth grade. That commitment shows up in the results: across Zeta's testing schools last year, 92% of students passed the New York State Math exams, with nearly half earning the highest score of 4. In English Language Arts, 86% passed—50 percentage points above local district averages and 36 percentage points above New York City's average. In Science, 92% passed, Zeta's strongest result since the state introduced its more rigorous next generation assessment. <br /><br />These results show what an education driven by love can achieve.<br /><br />At Zeta High, an education driven by love helps students build independence. Here, students discover their purpose, pursue their passions, and develop the power to direct their own lives.<br /><br />Students take advanced and AP courses, supported by free SAT preparation and one-on-one college advising. Through Z Lab, internships, and Z Journeys, they apply their learning beyond the classroom and explore real-world challenges. They also learn to advocate for themselves, and make thoughtful decisions about their futures. Z Pods and Z Houses give every student trusted mentors, a close community, and a strong sense of belonging.<br /><br />Join us for a <u><a href=\"https://zetaschools.org/events-for-prospective-families/\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">tour of Zeta High</font></a></u> and experience everything that could be part of your student’s high school journey.<br /><br />With warmth &amp; gratitude,<br /><br /><strong>Emily Kim<br />Founder, CEO &amp; Zeta Mom<br />Zeta Charter Schools</strong><br /><br /><em>Please reach out if you have any questions about Zeta. Our Enrollment Team is here for you every step of the way. ✉︎  <a href=\"mailto:enroll&#64;zetaschools.org\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer\"><u><font color=\"#0000ff\">enroll&#64;zetaschools.org</font></u></a></em><a href=\"mailto:enroll&#64;zetaschools.org\"><u> </u></a>&#x1f4de;(646) 480-1654"
            },
            "definition" : "lightning/paragraph",
            "id" : "dbea93e9-641e-460b-90bb-de0b58e7de90",
            "type" : "block"
